  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0 — tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.4.0 in lockstep; no changes to this package. The release adds cloud envelope-key providers to the family (PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Aws and PostQuantum.FileEncryption.AzureKeyVault). No format change: the .pqfe v2 container format remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
